I recommend the +7 fooproof Excalibur. Archons prefer long swords over
all other weapons and will not hang on to any other type of weapon.
Pets do not know enchantment on weapons (as opposed to armor).

Getting your pet to unwield its current weapon is the hard part. Find
a bullwhip, make sure you have enough dexterity to use it as a tool,
and repeatedly apply it toward the archon until you disarm it. You
will not reduce its tameness this way. Then you can give it Excalibur.
As soon as it picks up and wields Excalibur, you never need to worry
about its weapon again.

See the wiki for more aspects of archon care. Don't forget to pack a
leash for the Endgame portals.
